SE: The 'value' variable is directly output into HTML content using {\{\= $value \}\} without sanitation.
BL: {\<input data-color-value class="form-control"{\> \<?= $value \}\<\/span\>} and {\<input data-color-value class="form-control" placeholder="No color" value="{\$value}" {\ php if (\$disabled): \?> disabled {\ php endif \}\>\<}
